# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Postmortem: <!-- DECIDE: short, specific title for the regression -->

A structured record of one regression — human-caused or agent-caused — written after the fact so the
next person (or the next dispatched agent) does not have to reconstruct what happened from `git log`
and guesswork.

**Note on scope.** Unlike every other template this suite ships, this one names no design-system
concept — it is generic engineering-process content, kept here because the delivery mechanism
(`{{doc:postmortem}}`, resolved the same way every other role is) already exists and fits. If this
project has an existing incident-review process, use that format instead and do not install this
one merely because it is available.

**This document is append-only, like the decision log.** One file per regression, or one section per
regression in a shared log — <!-- DECIDE: which, and where new entries go -->. Never rewrite a past
entry's account of what happened; add a correction the way `{{doc:decisions}}` does.

